# Lab 6 – ANN Classification

## Aim
To implement an Artificial Neural Network (ANN) for multiclass classification using the Seeds Dataset.

## Dataset
- **Dataset:** Seeds Dataset
- **Records:** 210
- **Features:** 7
- **Classes:** 3

## Technologies
Python, Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, Seaborn, Scikit-learn, TensorFlow/Keras.

## Method
- Data preprocessing and visualization
- Feature scaling using StandardScaler
- 80:20 stratified train-test split
- ANN with Dense layers and ReLU activation
- Softmax output for multiclass classification
- Adam optimizer and Early Stopping

## Results
- **Test Accuracy:** 85.71%
- **Precision:** 86.25%
- **Recall:** 85.71%
- **F1-Score:** 85.00%

## Conclusion
The ANN model successfully classified the three seed classes with **85.71% test accuracy**.
